# (1.5.0-beta1) the ready-made sets for the beta's device test (build/design/BETA-1.5.0-HOWTO.txt), made by the host
# simulator from the recipes (not the user's pieces): run by tools/make_beta_sets.sh into build/beta-sets/.
#   five-echospace.dub1   "Echospace 12" (85 px of 87: the widest that fits), 5 pieces in another order than the
#                          recipes' (Night Drive first, Haze in slot 3), names from narrow to 84 px (WWWWWWW)
#   eight-full.dub1        "Full Eight", all 8 pieces, every one renamed, two of them near the limit
#   three-noglob.dub1      "Three", 3 pieces, no globals (the FM-1's Song mode, Transition and Tune kept)
wait 600
tap PLAY
wait 300
# five: Night Drive, Fog, Haze, Steppers, Basic; Song mode and the Transition as the recipes leave them
slotrecipe 0 5
slotrecipe 1 3
slotrecipe 2 7
slotrecipe 3 2
slotrecipe 4 0
name 0 Night Bus
name 1 Fog Bank
name 2 WWWWWWW
name 3 Dub Chamber
name 4 Go
name -1 Echospace 12
dub1set build/beta-sets/five-echospace.dub1 5
# eight: every slot its own recipe again, each renamed
slotrecipe 0 0
slotrecipe 1 1
slotrecipe 2 2
slotrecipe 3 3
slotrecipe 4 4
slotrecipe 5 5
slotrecipe 6 6
slotrecipe 7 7
name 0 One
name 1 Two Rooms
name 2 Echospace 12
name 3 Four
name 4 Five Steps
name 5 Six Nights
name 6 Dub Chamber
name 7 Last Haze
name -1 Full Eight
dub1set build/beta-sets/eight-full.dub1 8
# three, no globals
name 0 Morning
name 1 Noon
name 2 Night
name -1 Three
dub1set build/beta-sets/three-noglob.dub1 3 noglob
